p_870","layoutPosition":{"x":960,"y":240}},{"id":"b_bp_900","layoutPosition":{"x":1080,"y":240}},{"id":"b_bp_930","layoutPosition":{"x":1200,"y":240}},{"id":"b_bp_960","layoutPosition":{"x":1320,"y":240}},{"id":"b_bp_1020","layoutPosition":{"x":1560,"y":240}},{"id":"b_bp_1050","layoutPosition":{"x":1680,"y":240}},{"id":"b_bp_1080","layoutPosition":{"x":1920,"y":240}},{"id":"b_bp_1110","layoutPosition":{"x":2040,"y":240}},{"id":"b_bp_1140","layoutPosition":{"x":2160,"y":240}},{"id":"b_bp_1170","layoutPosition":{"x":2280,"y":240}},{"id":"b_bp_1200","layoutPosition":{"x":2400,"y":240}},{"id":"b_bp_1230","layoutPosition":{"x":2520,"y":240}},{"id":"b_bp_1260","layoutPosition":{"x":2640,"y":240}},{"id":"b_bp_2100","layoutPosition":{"x":3480,"y":240}},{"id":"b_bp_2130","layoutPosition":{"x":3600,"y":240}},{"id":"b_bp_2190","layoutPosition":{"x":3720,"y":240}},{"id":"b_bp_1065","layoutPosition":{"x":1800,"y":240}}],"schematicNotes":[{"id":"n_cavity_notes","text":"CAVITY NOTES - full text of the signals marked * on this drawing\nEFI Main Relay 85: ACTIVE-LOW Coil - -> Aux 6 / A28 - low-side (Aux 5-8 capable of either; low-side chosen for ECU Hold Power)\nEFI Main Relay 86: Coil + - PERMANENT battery via F12 5A (must stay live after key-off for Hold Power)\nETB Power Relay 85: ACTIVE-LOW Coil - -> Aux 2 / A20 - LOW-SIDE ONLY (Aux 1-4)\nETB Power Relay 86: Coil + - ignition-switched 12V (EFI main relay 87)\nFuel Pump Relay 85: ACTIVE-LOW Coil - -> Aux 3 / A19 - LOW-SIDE ONLY (Aux 1-4)\nFuel Pump Relay 86: Coil + - ignition-switched 12V (EFI main relay 87)\nRadiator Fan Relay (on/off) 86: Coil + - ignition-switched 12V (EFI main relay 87)\nStart Relay 86: Coil + - ignition-switched 12V (EFI main relay 87)\nCondenser Fan Relay (on/off, diode) 85: ACTIVE-LOW Coil - -> Ign 5 / B13 - low-side, NO internal flywheel diode - diode-suppressed relay fitted (TE 7-1904094-9)\nCondenser Fan Relay (on/off, diode) 86: Coil + - ignition-switched 12V (EFI main relay 87)\nECUMaster CSB3 - Power/CAN/Swi c26: L4 low-side - oil pressure LED sink (CAN 0x643); the wire from this pin to the LED is drawn on ST185-ClusterLED (dm_csb3io_c26)\nBulkhead A - firewall (HDP24-2 1: spare (size 16) - was the shared shield drain, retired by 6.32\nBulkhead B - firewall (HDP24-2 1: Switched 12V - INJECTOR power feed (size 12, 25A)\nBulkhead B - firewall (HDP24-2 2: Switched 12V - COP / ignition coil power feed (size 12, 25A)\nBulkhead B - firewall (HDP24-2 14: MRS EPS pump logic enable (F13 7.5A, ignition-switched)\nSensor Gnd Out splice (wired o c1: Gnd Out sensor ground rail -> ECU-A A24 / ECU-B B22. Knock 1 SIG- lands here, NOT on A7. A7 is shield ground and carries drains only.\nSensor +5V splice (wired on B- 1: +5V Out rail sp_5v -> ECU-A A32, wired on ST185-B-ECU\nSensor +8V splice (wired on B- 1: +8V Out rail sp_8v -> ECU-A A6, wired on ST185-B-ECU\ncsb3io (label): ECUMaster CSB3 (power feed \u2014 full I/O on ST185-A-ECU)\nCabin fuse block (passenger gl F12: 5A - relay coil feed, PERMANENT (EFI main relay 86)\nCabin fuse block (passenger gl F13: 7.5A - MRS EPS pump logic enable (ignition-switched)\nHigh-current fuse block HCFB H4: 60A AMI - EPS pump relay 30 (wire drawn on ST185-EngineRoom-C from dm_hcfb_h4)","schematicPosition":{"x":4200,"y":0}}],"wireParts":[{"id":"wp_20_blk","partNumber":"EW-1C20-BLK","manufacturer":"generic","description":"WIRE, ELECTRICAL, 20 AWG, BLACK, ETFE (TEFZEL) INSULATED, 150 C, M22759/16 OR EQUIV","color":"Black","gauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"}},{"id":"wp_20_blu","partNumber":"EW-1C20-BLU","manufacturer":"generic","description":"WIRE, ELECTRICAL, 20 AWG, BLUE, ETFE (TEFZEL) INSULATED, 150 C, M22759/16 OR EQUIV","color":"Blue","gauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"}},{"id":"wp_20_brn","partNumber":"EW-1C20-BRN","manufacturer":"generic","description":"WIRE, ELECTRICAL, 20 AWG, BROWN, ETFE (TEFZEL) INSULATED, 150 C, M22759/16 OR EQUIV","color":"Brown","gauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"}},{"id":"wp_20_grn","partNumber":"EW-1C20-GRN","manufacturer