_f7.jpg"}},{"partNumber":"7-1904094-9","manufacturer":"TE Connectivity","description":"RELAY, PLUG-IN, MAXI ISO, TE Power Relay F7 V23134-J0052-X439 - CONTACT FORM: 1 form A (N/O) - CONTACT RATING: 70 A at 23 C / 50 A at 85 C / 30 A at 125 C (limiting continuous, F7 family datasheet) - COIL: 12 VDC, 91 OHM +/-10% - SUPPRESSION: DIODE, cathode on 86 (86 MUST be coil +, 85 coil -; reversed polarity shorts the diode) - Checked 2026-09-26 against TE customer drawing C-V23134-J0052-X439 rev A2 + datasheet V23134X0000A002 rev 2607 + te.com product page; plugs into socket 1393310-4; required on Ign 5 / B13 (no flywheel diode in the ECU output)","numberOfCavities":4,"configurations":[{"id":"cfg","contactPartId":"ct_f7_load","mountPartId":"mt_vcf7"}],"id":"cp_rly_f7_d","image":{"source":"url","url":"https://www.te.com/catalog/common/images/PartImages/pr_relay_power_f7.jpg","lowResUrl":"https://www.te.com/catalog/common/images/PartThumbnails/th_relay_power_f7.jpg"}},{"id":"cp_dt06_6s","partNumber":"DT06-6S","manufacturer":"TE DEUTSCH","description":"CONNECTOR, PLUG, DT, 6 POS, SOCKET CONTACTS, N SEAL, GRAY - wheel-speed inline interface, ECU spur side (receiving half; supplies +5V, so it carries the sockets)","numberOfCavities":6,"gender":"Female","hasShell":false,"configurations":[{"id":"cfg","contactPartId":"ct_hdp16s","cavityPlugPartId":"pl_sz16","lockPartId":"lp_w6s"}],"url":"https://www.te.com/usa-en/product-DT06-6S.html"},{"id":"cp_dt04_2p","partNumber":"DT04-2P","manufacturer":"TE DEUTSCH","description":"CONNECTOR, RECEPTACLE, DT, 2 POS, PIN CONTACTS, N SEAL, GRAY - 2-way inline interface, source half","numberOfCavities":2,"gender":"Male","hasShell":false,"configurations":[{"id":"cfg","contactPartId":"ct_hdp16p","cavityPlugPartId":"pl_sz16","lockPartId":"lp_w2p"}],"url":"https://www.te.com/usa-en/product-DT04-2P.html"},{"partNumber":"(pump pigtail - Walbro F90000295)","manufacturer":"Walbro","description":"CONNECTOR, PIGTAIL, 2 POS - supplied on the Walbro F90000295 pu